<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
<head>
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <style>
        * { box-sizing: border-box; }
        .main { width: 100%; padding: 20px; color: #334155; }
        .card { background-color: #f8fafc; border: 1px solid #e2e8f0; border-radius: 12px; padding: 24px; margin: 20px 0; }
        .footer { background-color: #7C3AED; color: white; text-align: center; padding: 15px; border-radius: 8px; margin-top: 20px; }
        .label { font-weight: bold; color: #64748b; text-transform: uppercase; font-size: 11px; letter-spacing: 0.05em; }
        .value { color: #1e293b; font-weight: 600; margin-bottom: 12px; }
    </style>
</head>
<body style="font-family: 'Segoe UI', Tahoma, Geneva, Verdana, sans-serif; line-height: 1.6; background-color: #f1f5f9; padding: 20px;">

<div style="max-width: 600px; margin: 0 auto; background-color: white; border-radius: 16px; overflow: hidden; shadow: 0 4px 6px -1px rgb(0 0 0 / 0.1);">
    <div style="background-color: #7C3AED; padding: 30px; text-align: center;">
        <h1 style="color: white; margin: 0; font-size: 24px;">Nouvelle Demande Immoplus</h1>
    </div>

    <div class="main">
        <p>Bonjour l'équipe,</p>
        <p>Une nouvelle demande de plan annuel a été soumise depuis la landing page.</p>

        <div class="card">
            <div class="label">Plan souhaité</div>
            <div class="value" style="color: #7C3AED; font-size: 18px;">{{ planName }}</div>

            <div class="label">Nom complet</div>
            <div class="value">{{ name }}</div>

            <div class="label">Agence / Entreprise</div>
            <div class="value">{{ company }}</div>

            <div class="label">Email de contact</div>
            <div class="value"><a href="mailto:{{ email_content }}" style="color: #7C3AED;">{{ email_content }}</a></div>

            <div class="label">Téléphone</div>
            <div class="value">{{ phone }}</div>

            {% if message %}
            <div style="margin-top: 20px; padding-top: 20px; border-top: 1px dashed #cbd5e1;">
                <div class="label">Message / Précisions</div>
                <div class="value" style="font-style: italic; font-weight: 400;">"{{ message }}"</div>
            </div>
            {% endif %}
        </div>

        <p>Veuillez recontacter ce prospect dans les plus brefs délais pour finaliser son inscription.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="footer">
        <p style="margin: 0; font-size: 12px; font-weight: bold;">© {{ "now"|date("Y") }} Motiplus - Gestion Immobilière Intelligente</p>
    </div>
</div>

</body>
</html>
